                "uri": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFEMV_BTJnl8LPc8Oerwf5muhDeaz3vD2pC6Zn7VtN-aIJzmqhrVCBWJUkrN3XwohD38F2TQHfcKgqhjut3-HTV2juvdR8xBF7RQ3d0kNEFbuA6IStSvOdeDyimHWjrEiQKgMYjKVGpTZTs8nXa9bgLVATZh4nbYzlatBChxdAnstX1NF4NTNlUcsXivPkaBZTvG_bAfw=="
              }
            }
          ],
          "grounding_supports": [
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": null,
                "end_index": 215,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "While there is no physical limit to how many movements you can create to propel yourself through the water, there are **8 to 10 major, widely recognized swimming styles** (commonly called strokes) that you can learn"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 219,
                "end_index": 395,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "These styles are generally categorized into two groups: **the 4 competitive strokes** (used in races and Olympics) and **the 4 to 6 utility, survival, or recreational strokes**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 403,
                "end_index": 545,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "### Group 1: The 4 Competitive Strokes (The \"Big Four\")\nThese are the standard strokes taught in swim schools and used in competitive swimming"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 547,
                "end_index": 636,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Master these, and you can swim in almost any pool or competitive environment in the world"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 642,
                "end_index": 669,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Freestyle / Front Crawl**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                0,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 642,
                "end_index": 736,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Freestyle / Front Crawl**\n   * **What it is:** The fastest and most efficient swimming style"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 738,
                "end_index": 889,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "You lie on your stomach, flutter-kick your legs, and alternate your arms in a continuous windmill motion while turning your head to the side to breathe"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 894,
                "end_index": 982,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Why learn it:** It is the best stroke for cardiovascular fitness and calorie burning"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 987,
                "end_index": 1001,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Backstroke**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 987,
                "end_index": 1072,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Backstroke**\n   * **What it is:** Essentially the front crawl but done on your back"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1074,
                "end_index": 1126,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "You use an alternating arm circle and a flutter kick"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4,
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1132,
                "end_index": 1231,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Why learn it:** Because your face is out of the water the entire time, breathing is much easier"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1233,
                "end_index": 1331,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It is also highly recommended by physical therapists for improving posture and relieving back pain"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1336,
                "end_index": 1352,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Breaststroke**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                9
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1336,
                "end_index": 1421,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Breaststroke**\n   * **What it is:** The oldest and most popular recreational stroke"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                9,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1423,
                "end_index": 1551,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "You lie on your chest, pull your arms in a heart-shaped sweep in front of you, and perform a powerful \"whip kick\" (or frog kick)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1557,
                "end_index": 1716,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Why learn it:** It is highly stable and allows you to keep your head above water if needed, making it great for casual swimming or navigating crowded pools"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1721,
                "end_index": 1734,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Butterfly**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1721,
                "end_index": 1814,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Butterfly**\n   * **What it is:** The most physically demanding and visually dramatic stroke"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1,
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1816,
                "end_index": 2003,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It requires you to bring both arms over the water simultaneously in a sweeping motion while executing two \"dolphin kicks\" (legs pressed together, moving like a mermaid tail) per arm cycle"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4,
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2008,
                "end_index": 2141,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Why learn it:** It offers an incredible core and upper-body workout, though it requires a high level of strength and coordination"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2149,
                "end_index": 2325,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "### Group 2: The Utility, Survival & Recreational Strokes\nThese strokes are rarely seen in races but are incredibly useful for resting, saving energy, or swimming in open water"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2331,
                "end_index": 2356,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Elementary Backstroke**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2331,
                "end_index": 2437,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Elementary Backstroke**\n   * **What it is:** A highly relaxed, symmetrical stroke performed on your back"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2439,
                "end_index": 2609,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It is often taught using the mnemonic *\"Soldier, Monkey, Airplane\"* (hands at your sides, hands slid up to your armpits, arms extended outward, and then pushed back down)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2614,
                "end_index": 2680,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Why learn it:** It is the ultimate survival and resting stroke"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2682,
                "end_index": 2790,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It requires very little energy, keeps your face fully out of the water, and lets you rest while still moving"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2795,
                "end_index": 2809,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Sidestroke**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2795,
                "end_index": 2945,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Sidestroke**\n   * **What it is:** Swum on your side using a \"scissor kick\" (legs opening and closing like scissors) and an asymmetrical arm movement"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                12
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2947,
                "end_index": 3019,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "One arm acts as a lead guide while the other pushes water down your body"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3024,
                "end_index": 3131,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Why learn it:** It is widely used by lifeguards to tow victims because it keeps one arm completely free"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                0,
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3137,
                "end_index": 3164,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Combat Sidestroke (CSS)**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3547,
                "end_index": 3578,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**The Trudgen / Trudgen Crawl**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3547,
                "end_index": 3737,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**The Trudgen / Trudgen Crawl**\n   * **What it is:** Named after swimmer John Trudgen, this style combines the overhand arm strokes of the front crawl with the scissor kick of the sidestroke"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1,
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3886,
                "end_index": 3900,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Dog Paddle**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                9,
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3886,
                "end_index": 4097,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Dog Paddle**\n   * **What it is:** The most basic instinctual stroke, where you lie on your stomach and patter your hands and feet in a quick, dog-like paddling motion with your head completely out of the water"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4352,
                "end_index": 4542,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **For Basic Safety/Survival (2 strokes):** Learn the **Dog Paddle** (to keep your head up in an emergency) and the **Elementary Backstroke** (to float and rest without exhausting yourself)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4544,
                "end_index": 4731,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **For General Fitness & Recreation (3 strokes):** Learn **Freestyle** (for cardio), **Backstroke** (for posture/spine health), and **Breaststroke** (for casual, easy-breathing swimming)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3,
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4733,
                "end_index": 4865,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **For Competitive Swimming (4 strokes):** You must learn the standard four: **Freestyle, Backstroke, Breaststroke, and Butterfly**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1,
                0
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4867,
                "end_index": 5027,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **For Military, Lifesaving, or Open-Water (5+ strokes):** Add the **Sidestroke** or **Combat Sidestroke** to your repertoire to handle rough waters and towing"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            }
          ],
          "retrieval_metadata": null,
          "search_entry_point": {
